{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;He disappeared without a word. Now she\u2019s trapped on an island full of horrors\u2014and her only ally may no longer be human.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Part of Him Remains</i> is a <strong>psychological survival horror</strong> game blending emotional storytelling, suspenseful exploration, and tense encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf <strong>Survive Against the Infected</strong> \u2013 Face mindless horrors and uncover what turned them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc94 <strong>An Unforgettable Love Story</strong> \u2013 Find out what remains of the man she came to save.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfdd <strong>Explore a Ruined Island</strong> \u2013 Scavenge for resources and shelter while avoiding danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2c <strong>Corporate Secrets &amp; Experiments</strong> \u2013 Discover the sinister truth behind the mutation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Stealth &amp; Strategy Matter</strong> \u2013 Hide, run, or fight\u2014but every choice has consequences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As she uncovers the truth, one question remains:<br><strong>Can she escape\u2026 and does he even want to?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd16 <strong>Wishlist Now &amp; Follow for Updates!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626960?t=1743775435","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626960?t=1743775435","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626960/0fb9e0805630be038b68edba8cde095055b5f166/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743775435","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/